OpenCC — TSCharacters.txt
==========================

`TSCharacters.txt` is the traditional→simplified character table from
Open Chinese Convert (OpenCC): https://github.com/ByVoid/OpenCC

License: Apache-2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

The file is copied unchanged from the Flutter client's
`app/assets/opencc/TSCharacters.txt`, so both clients convert lyrics the same
way (plan §2.4 #33). `internal/metadata/opencc.go` embeds it; only the first
candidate of each line is used, matching
`app/lib/sources/scraper/chinese_converter.dart`.
